# Distant blast: sub body, filtered brown-noise blast, crack, long rumble.
sound "explosion" 1200ms explosion
  # The part you feel rather than hear.
  boom: sub 70Hz -> 28Hz in 400ms | gain 0.7 attack 6ms decay 900ms
  blast: noise brown >> lp ~1200Hz[400..4000] -> 180Hz in 700ms | gain 0.45 decay 800ms
  crack: noise white >> hp 3000Hz | gain 0.28 decay 90ms
  rumble: noise pink >> lp 300Hz | gain 0.2 decay 1100ms delay 120ms
